Z||000003||PBJ||06-28-2001||12:33 PM||||If it needs to be inspected than you must have a working park brake.  By good quality brake pads and your fiero SHOULD/WILL stop fine with all fiero components working.<P>That would suck to have your car inspected, we just have to have it inspected when we put it on the road after buying it.  But like every thing else I am sure things will change.||||reg||1
Z||000004||DecadenceR||06-28-2001||04:17 PM||||Unfortunately we have to have ours inspected once every 2 years in NJ. It used to be once a year, but that changed when we got the new emission standards.||||reg||1
